<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Distributional RL</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the distributional reinforcement learning experiments, we use Implicit Quantile Networks (IQN). The implementation builds directly on the same JAX codebase as the DQN experiments, ensuring consistency in architecture and training setup. The key algorithm-specific hyperparameters are listed in Table <a href="#A3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ C.2 Distributional RL ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ Use the Online Network If You Can: Towards Fast and Stable Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></th>
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:2.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#9467BD;"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:17.0pt;height:1.2pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span> <span id="A3.T3.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">IQN</span></td>
<td id="A3.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;"><span id="A3.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:2.2pt;--ltx-fg-color:#CE1126;"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:17.0pt;height:1.2pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span> <span id="A3.T3.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">IQN+MINTO</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;">Replay Buffer Capacity</th>
<td id="A3.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1pt;padding-bottom:1pt;" colspan="2">1,000,000</td></tr>
