</section>
<section id="A3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.4 </span>Online RL and Continuous Control</h3>

<div id="A3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For our continuous-control experiments with online reinforcement learning, we adopt SimbaV1 and SimbaV2. The implementation is based on the official SimbaV2 codebase<span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
              
              
              
            <a href="https://github.com/dojeon-ai/SimbaV2" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/dojeon-ai/SimbaV2</a></span></span></span> (<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lee et al. (2025)</a></cite>), ensuring consistency with the original work. All experiments use the default hyperparameters provided by the authors, with the most relevant ones summarized in Tables <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ C.4 Online RL and Continuous Control ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ Use the Online Network If You Can: Towards Fast and Stable Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ C.4 Online RL and Continuous Control ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ Use the Online Network If You Can: Towards Fast and Stable Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A3.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
